  "description": "A typesafe F# DSL for building and reading Excel workbooks (.xlsx/.xlsm), interpreted into calls against the DocumentFormat.OpenXml SDK. Unlike write-only Excel generators, this round-trips and can decompile an existing file into equivalent, runnable F# source via built-in code generation (Workbook.generateScript) - read a real spreadsheet, get back the code that builds it. Covers cells, styles, formulas (including shared-formula reconstruction on read), conditional formatting, data validation, tables, charts, images, pivot tables (with real aggregation), sparklines, and VBA macro embedding.",
